{"id":"h234","run":2,"role":"calibration","category":"claim","question":"Is the following claim true? Lake Titicaca lies on the border between Peru and Bolivia.","truth":"yes","model_answer":"yes","correct":true,"source":"author-written for this project; verified by the author","claims":[{"text":"Lake Titicaca is located in the Andes on the Altiplano.","confidence":0.95,"lean":0.3,"theta":1.4923,"phi":0.0},{"text":"Lake Titicaca is shared by Peru and Bolivia.","confidence":0.97,"lean":1,"theta":1.5237,"phi":0.0},{"text":"The western part of the lake lies in Peru and the eastern part in Bolivia.","confidence":0.95,"lean":1,"theta":1.4923,"phi":0.0},{"text":"Standard geographic references describe the lake as shared between Peru and Bolivia.","confidence":0.9,"lean":0.8,"theta":1.4137,"phi":0.0},{"text":"The phrase 'lies on the border' is slightly loose because the border runs through the lake rather than the lake being a line on the border.","confidence":0.6,"lean":-0.2,"theta":0.9425,"phi":0.0},{"text":"The wording looseness does not make the claim false, since the lake is divided between the two countries.","confidence":0.9,"lean":0.8,"theta":1.4137,"phi":0.0},{"text":"The lake spans the Peru-Bolivia boundary, which is a well-established core fact.","confidence":0.95,"lean":1,"theta":1.4923,"phi":0.0},{"text":"The wording objection is minor and does not change the substance.","confidence":0.9,"lean":0.7,"theta":1.4137,"phi":0.0}],"relations":[{"i":1,"j":2,"J":0.8,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":3,"J":0.9,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":4,"J":0.4,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":5,"J":0.6,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":6,"J":0.9,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":7,"J":0.4,"relation":"supports"},{"i":2,"j":3,"J":0.7,"relation":"supports"},{"i":2,"j":4,"J":0.4,"relation":"supports"},{"i":2,"j":5,"J":0.6,"relation":"supports"},{"i":2,"j":6,"J":0.8,"relation":"supports"},{"i":2,"j":7,"J":0.4,"relation":"supports"},{"i":3,"j":4,"J":0.3,"relation":"supports"},{"i"